---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure — AICost Matrix" description="Affiliate and advertising disclosure for aicost.apexcraftweb.com" canonical="https://aicost.apexcraftweb.com/disclosure">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>AICost Matrix participates in affiliate programs. When you click certain links and make purchases, we may earn a commission. This does not affect our editorial content or the prices you pay.</p>
    <h2>Current Affiliate Relationships</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Amazon Web Services (AWS Bedrock) — affiliate links marked with rel="sponsored"</li>
      <li>Various GPU cloud providers — links may carry referral parameters</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="noopener sponsored"</code> in compliance with Google's guidelines and FTC disclosure requirements.</p>
    <p>The AI API pricing data on this site is independently researched and not influenced by any affiliate relationship.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
